Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.75,0:01:01.02,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,ring out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.40,0:01:11.60,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,50)}That feeling we had when we set sail
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.68,0:01:15.07,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,is something I'll never forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.25,0:01:16.86,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Because of that
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.03,0:01:20.53,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,nothing will be able to scare me...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.83,0:01:26.78,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Now, as the trip approaches, our racing heartbeats
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.00,0:01:33.76,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,engrave a rhythm of adventure in our shy hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.95,0:01:38.13,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,50)}Get all the treasures
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.23,0:01:40.43,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,while laughing out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.51,0:01:44.80,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Give them all out at a big party
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.89,0:01:47.47,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(50,50)}making a splash...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.60,0:02:04.72,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Fill your empty heart with dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.82,0:02:07.06,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Spread your wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.24,0:02:11.39,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,If you color your heart with the blowing wind
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.46,0:02:13.73,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,90)}you will move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.73,0:02:17.90,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Get all the treasures
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.07,0:02:20.17,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,while laughing out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.30,0:02:24.56,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,Give them all out at a big party
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.72,0:02:27.31,Jungle P lyrics,,0,0,0,,making a splash...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.46,0:02:39.23,Title,,0,0,200,,{\an8\fad(2000,2000)}現身吧，草帽海賊團！\N船員們絕望的反擊！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.31,0:02:46.91,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,喂！怎麼了，辛朵莉醬？！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.91,0:02:48.18,Main,Cindry,0,0,0,,我的身體...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.76,0:02:50.92,Main,Cindry,0,0,0,,動不了了。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.42,0:02:53.87,Main,Cindry,0,0,0,,眼淚流出來了...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.91,0:02:56.76,Main,Cindry,0,0,0,,不由自主地。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.76,0:02:58.61,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,你的身體動不了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.61,0:03:00.35,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,你在說什麼鬼話？！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.35,0:03:02.19,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,別再假哭了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.83,0:03:08.95,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,你覺得你能像有靈魂一樣活動該感謝誰？！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.10,0:03:15.12,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,你們殭屍的存在就是為了服從主人的命令！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.12,0:03:19.18,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,就好像身體的主人在反抗一樣...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.84,0:03:22.86,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,儘管她十年前就已經死了...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.86,0:03:26.32,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,沒有靈魂的身體會有感情嗎...？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.72,0:03:28.49,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,也許吧...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.49,0:03:31.81,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,就算調查全世界的圖書館也找不到答案。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.03,0:03:36.66,Main,Cindry,0,0,0,,我會... 殺了你們...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.95,0:03:38.24,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,就是這樣！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.24,0:03:41.47,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,你終於清醒了，辛朵莉醬！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.47,0:03:44.64,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,一定要拖住他們直到我離開這裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.64,0:03:46.46,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,真可惜...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.46,0:03:49.86,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,我還以為我見證了一個奇蹟...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.86,0:03:51.14,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}十二輪花！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.86,0:03:51.14,Note,Note,0,0,100,,{\fad(150,150)}十二輪花
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.00,0:03:57.15,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.27,0:04:02.00,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,這、這個搖晃是怎麼回事？！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.69,0:04:07.28,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,可惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.28,0:04:11.85,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,你這笨海賊鹿！裝成人類站在死者那邊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.44,0:04:14.79,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,你根本不是人！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.79,0:04:16.03,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,你這笨怪物！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.49,0:04:18.09,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,我們的船長...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.09,0:04:22.80,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,不管你是怪物、半機械人、變態、長鼻子、還是綠藻頭...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.80,0:04:24.88,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,他都能讓任何人追隨他！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.64,0:04:29.66,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,不像你，只會利用沒有思想的屍體來達成自己的目的！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.89,0:04:32.35,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,放開我，混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.35,0:04:33.51,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,羅賓！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.90,0:04:35.49,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,好的，交給我！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.34,0:04:37.72,Note,Robin,0,0,100,,{\fad(150,150)}腿花
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.34,0:04:37.72,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}腿花！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.24,0:04:40.97,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,咦？什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.75,0:04:50.08,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,等、等一下，喬巴醫生！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.08,0:04:52.33,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,如果你從這麼高的地方砸我的頭...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.33,0:04:55.38,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,全世界最偉大天才的腦子就會被毀掉！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.38,0:04:56.92,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,你想這樣嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.92,0:04:58.06,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,我無所謂。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.41,0:05:02.96,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,你的腦子比你那些殭屍還爛！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.96,0:05:04.33,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,接招吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.33,0:05:06.55,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}羅賓喬巴過肩摔！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.37,0:05:14.91,Captions,Sign,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(600,600)}附近，特殊冷凍室
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.57,0:05:14.67,Main,Luffy,0,0,100,,{\an8}比巨人還要大得多。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.03,0:05:17.68,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,所以這就是我的殭屍。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.75,0:05:23.02,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,我等你很久了，奧茲！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.02,0:05:27.11,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,身體和影子終於融合了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.11,0:05:30.19,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,你現在是完全服從的殭屍了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.19,0:05:33.11,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,回答！你的主人是誰？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.99,0:05:37.27,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,我的主人是莫利亞大人。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.60,0:05:39.25,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.19,0:05:42.99,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,喂，你在說什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.99,0:05:44.99,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,你真的是我的影子嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.99,0:05:46.46,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,別聽他的！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.47,0:05:50.80,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,你是誰，戴草帽的傢伙？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.70,0:05:56.20,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,那麼，我給你下第一個命令。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.20,0:06:00.80,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,他們目前正在Thriller Bark各處大鬧。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.80,0:06:03.74,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,那就是草帽海賊團。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.74,0:06:08.03,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,毫不留情地粉碎他們，把他們趕回船上。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.03,0:06:10.48,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,他們是死是活，我不在乎！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.48,0:06:16.12,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,反正對那些懸賞超過一億的人來說，些許暴力不會要了他們的命。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.12,0:06:17.88,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,不要手下留情！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.88,0:06:20.67,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,讓他們嚐嚐你的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.67,0:06:23.40,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,是，莫利亞大人。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.63,0:06:28.59,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,啊！找到你了，草帽小子。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.47,0:06:32.27,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,回頭見，草帽小子！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.47,0:06:34.74,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,你別想逃！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.74,0:06:38.21,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}橡膠...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.68,0:06:40.17,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,等、等、等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.17,0:06:41.21,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,危險！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.41,0:06:43.73,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}鐘擺！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.09,0:06:48.95,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.95,0:06:50.11,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,魯夫的殭屍！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.11,0:06:51.72,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,奧茲！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.41,0:06:53.66,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,地板在崩塌！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.66,0:06:55.29,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,喬巴，往這邊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.80,0:07:03.37,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,好險。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.70,0:07:08.59,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,所以這就是...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.59,0:07:10.04,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,魯夫？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.04,0:07:13.41,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,霍古巴克和辛朵莉都掉到下面的樓層了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.41,0:07:14.65,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,可惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.65,0:07:16.21,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,太重了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.21,0:07:20.18,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,辛朵莉醬，搬開這塊石頭...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.43,0:07:23.60,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,辛、辛朵莉醬，快點！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.60,0:07:24.56,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,快來幫我！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.32,0:07:27.89,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,看，奧茲要來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.48,0:07:29.99,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,我...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.99,0:07:32.20,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,我，偉大的天才...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.20,0:07:34.31,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,要被壓扁了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.31,0:07:36.69,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,喂，你為什麼站在那裡發呆？！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.69,0:07:39.50,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,我是你的主人！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.35,0:07:49.05,Main,Cindry,0,0,0,,我的身體...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.05,0:07:50.20,Main,Cindry,0,0,0,,動不了了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.36,0:07:51.82,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.15,0:07:57.33,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,又來那套荒唐的廢話！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.33,0:08:01.04,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,你們殭屍的存在就是為了效忠！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.04,0:08:03.22,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,快來幫我！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.22,0:08:05.36,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,你只不過是個花瓶！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.36,0:08:07.00,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,你這沒用的屍體！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.54,0:08:20.41,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,喂！快點，辛朵莉！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.41,0:08:22.80,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,奧茲來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.42,0:08:28.81,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,奧茲，往下看，你這笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.81,0:08:30.69,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,是我，你這忘恩負義的白癡！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.69,0:08:34.84,Main,Hogback,0,0,0,,是我修好你的身體讓你能重新活動的！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.95,0:08:44.30,Captions,Sign,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(550,0)}附近，培羅娜房間外的走廊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.54,0:08:43.62,Main,Usopp,0,0,100,,{\an8}等、等、等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.62,0:08:44.30,Main,Usopp,0,0,100,,{\an8}怎、怎麼回事？！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.06,0:08:48.14,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,這些震動完全不同！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.75,0:08:53.09,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,魯、魯、魯...！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.09,0:08:55.05,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,魯夫的殭屍！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.09,0:08:57.45,Captions,Sign,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(550,0)}附近，教堂內
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.59,0:09:01.62,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,喂喂喂喂！這個搖晃是怎麼回事？！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.69,0:09:07.93,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,不會吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.93,0:09:09.29,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,魯夫的殭屍？！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.00,0:09:12.93,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,可惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.30,0:09:16.13,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,娜美小姐，現在不是睡覺的時候！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.13,0:09:17.81,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,沒辦法了...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.81,0:09:19.07,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,我們得逃走。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.38,0:09:23.27,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,娜美小姐？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.22,0:09:27.95,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,娜美小姐不見了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.38,0:09:33.28,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,難道...！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.31,0:09:38.64,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,局勢逆轉了...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.29,0:09:41.28,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.28,0:09:42.77,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,你還有意識？！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.77,0:09:45.03,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,獸人，給我出來！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.60,0:09:51.47,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,看來這個惡魔終於成為我們的僕人了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.47,0:09:53.55,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,將軍！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.55,0:09:56.07,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,這次新娘歸我了！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.91,0:09:58.08,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,可惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.08,0:09:59.46,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,把娜美小姐還來！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.46,0:10:01.38,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,你躲在哪裡？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.95,0:10:06.28,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,好好享受跟終極殭屍的相處吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.30,0:10:29.12,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,有東西出來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.50,0:10:32.78,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,那、那是...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.55,0:10:35.02,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,殭屍！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.02,0:10:36.81,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,是魯夫的殭屍。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.81,0:10:38.38,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,看那邊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.38,0:10:39.63,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,出來的那個人...！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.63,0:10:41.65,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,那不是捲眉毛廚子嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.05,0:10:44.29,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,可惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.29,0:10:45.73,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,娜美小姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.73,0:10:49.06,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,那個笨廚師在裡面幹什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.19,0:10:53.25,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.78,0:10:55.38,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,莫利亞！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.60,0:10:59.66,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,所以你要繼續追我嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.66,0:11:01.76,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,那個巨大的複製品雖然讓我在意，但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.76,0:11:06.83,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,如果要拿回大家的影子，就得揍飛莫利亞才行！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.83,0:11:09.31,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,你別想逃！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.93,0:11:13.89,Captions,Sign,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(600,0)}教堂
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.85,0:11:15.64,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,看好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.64,0:11:17.89,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,笑到最後的是我！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.90,0:11:20.86,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,看來你還在沉睡中...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.40,0:11:22.96,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,我會找到新的地點...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.96,0:11:27.15,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,我們會再次舉行婚禮。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.15,0:11:29.57,Main,Absalom,0,0,0,,我沉默的新娘啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.15,0:11:32.83,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,培羅娜大人沒事吧？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.83,0:11:34.37,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,她失去了意識。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.37,0:11:36.17,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,看起來沒有受傷。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.17,0:11:39.05,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,庫瑪西指揮官和副指揮官都被幹掉了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.05,0:11:41.10,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,那個長鼻子混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.10,0:11:42.20,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,我們帶她離開這裡。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.20,0:11:44.11,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,這座大宅太危險了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.11,0:11:46.59,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,特殊殭屍會替我們報仇的！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.12,0:11:49.94,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,遠離大宅！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.11,0:11:52.59,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,特殊殭屍在戰鬥！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.86,0:11:55.23,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,他大得要命！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.23,0:11:58.56,Main,Zombie,0,0,0,,我能看到他的頭比大宅還高！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.81,0:12:00.03,Captions,Sign,0,0,100,,{\an8\pos(720,100)\fad(600,0)}培羅娜的奇幻花園
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.50,0:12:03.50,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,騙人布！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.86,0:12:05.20,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,喬巴！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.20,0:12:06.00,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,羅賓！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.00,0:12:07.97,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,糟、糟、糟糕了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.97,0:12:09.92,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,魯、魯、魯夫殭屍的手臂上是...！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.92,0:12:11.81,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,我、我、我們的...！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.81,0:12:14.41,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,通緝令！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.52,0:12:18.25,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,他...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.42,0:12:24.04,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,絕對是衝著我們來的！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.32,0:12:29.49,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,現身吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.49,0:12:35.43,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,草帽海賊團！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.49,0:12:39.31,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,那個混蛋...！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.31,0:12:42.09,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,現在又來擋我們的路了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.93,0:12:44.10,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,那個魯夫！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.10,0:12:46.91,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,他真的打算毀掉自己的船員嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.67,0:12:49.32,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,他肯定是被命令這麼做的。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.21,0:12:52.47,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,不知道真正的魯夫沒事吧...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.68,0:12:54.92,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,那是什麼東西？！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.62,0:12:58.37,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,我們真的打得贏那種怪物嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.40,0:13:00.96,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,有意思。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.96,0:13:11.67,Main,Luffy,0,0,0,,等一下，莫利亞！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.80,0:13:17.32,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,死路。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.24,0:13:27.52,Main,Moria,0,0,0,,你待在這裡的時候，你所有的船員都在成為你自身力量的犧牲品呢，草帽小子！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.21,0:13:41.28,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,那是什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.28,0:13:43.11,Main,Brook,0,0,0,,好恐怖的臉！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.61,0:13:44.14,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,那是...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.94,0:13:49.87,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,喂！騙人布！那邊的是你嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.87,0:13:50.91,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,索隆！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.91,0:13:52.64,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你在屋頂幹什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.04,0:13:56.71,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,佛朗基、布魯克，你們兩個沒事！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.56,0:13:59.84,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,喂！讓開！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.84,0:14:03.44,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,魯夫你為什麼擋我們的路？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.86,0:14:09.79,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,魯夫...？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.01,0:14:15.50,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,他是... 我的敵人。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.34,0:14:20.30,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,我的名字是奧茲。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.30,0:14:22.52,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,請多指教！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.78,0:14:31.48,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,他在挑釁那個怪物。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.48,0:14:33.40,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,那個笨廚師...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.40,0:14:35.45,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,他至少有救到娜美嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.96,0:14:39.19,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,你現在不是比擔心那個女孩更該擔心自己嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.19,0:14:40.99,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,糟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.99,0:14:42.41,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,香吉士有危險！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.41,0:14:43.99,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,真是意料之外。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.99,0:14:47.76,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,我以為他們只是來搶影子的。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.76,0:14:49.73,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,或許我們惹了太多麻煩了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.73,0:14:53.47,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,看來他們只是衝著魯夫的影子來的。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.47,0:14:54.62,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,好恐怖。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.62,0:14:55.62,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,太恐怖了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.62,0:14:57.48,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,我們不可能打贏那種怪物！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.78,0:15:05.65,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,你的臉跟這張通緝令上的很像。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.35,0:15:09.92,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,你是海賊團的一員。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.68,0:15:15.76,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}橡膠...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.76,0:15:17.08,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,魯夫的招式！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.08,0:15:18.56,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,他要伸長嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.96,0:15:21.00,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,他也是橡膠人嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.27,0:15:22.86,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}鐮刀！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.28,0:15:26.52,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,他沒有伸長，但是...！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.52,0:15:30.44,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,以那種範圍和破壞力，根本不需要！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.83,0:15:32.24,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,奧茲...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.24,0:15:34.08,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,我聽過那個名字...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.08,0:15:38.13,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,他就是傳說中的「國家掠奪者」魔人奧茲嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.75,0:15:45.24,Main,Sanji,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}頸肉油炸！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.75,0:15:45.24,Note,Sign,0,0,100,,{\fad(150,150)}油炸頸肉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.06,0:15:53.36,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,香吉士！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.36,0:15:55.37,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,那麼巨大卻那麼快。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.75,0:16:00.68,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,糟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.68,0:16:01.77,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,他會死的！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.11,0:16:05.38,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,喂！住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.38,0:16:06.98,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,香吉士！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.98,0:16:09.71,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,消失吧，小海賊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.39,0:16:11.82,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}火鳥星！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.50,0:16:22.46,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,香吉士！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.64,0:16:37.07,Main,Usopp and Chopper,0,0,0,,他朝這邊來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.90,0:16:38.97,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,糟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.97,0:16:41.31,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,佛朗基，把他引過來！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.68,0:16:43.10,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,收到！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.10,0:16:44.40,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,接招吧，怪物！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.12,0:16:54.26,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,小心！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.93,0:16:58.56,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,你們兩個，到下面的屋頂去！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.56,0:16:59.99,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}一猩猩。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.99,0:17:01.19,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}二猩猩！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.62,0:17:03.88,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}三刀流...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.86,0:17:06.30,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}二猩猩斬首！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.54,0:17:13.51,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}橡膠...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.01,0:17:15.81,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}火山！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.08,0:17:19.54,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,索隆！你沒事吧？！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.54,0:17:23.70,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,從那麼高掉下來會死人的！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.70,0:17:25.42,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,接招吧，怪物！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.63,0:17:28.26,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}武器左手！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.89,0:17:32.40,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,好驚人的敏捷度！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.40,0:17:33.28,Main,Franky,0,0,0,,他又躲開了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.95,0:17:44.96,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,佛朗基！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.96,0:17:46.34,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,布魯克！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.50,0:17:50.88,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,索隆掉下來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.88,0:17:52.18,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}百輪花！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.88,0:17:52.18,Note,Robin,0,0,100,,{\fad(150,150)}百輪花
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.18,0:17:52.98,Main,Robin,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}蜘蛛網！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.89,0:18:00.29,Main,Zoro,0,0,0,,可惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.03,0:18:06.76,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,接招吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.76,0:18:08.36,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,你也是殭屍！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.70,0:18:10.92,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}必殺... 鹽彈星！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.95,0:18:23.15,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,不、不夠對付那麼巨大的身體！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.95,0:18:25.62,Main,Chopper,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}重鉗！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.84,0:18:52.32,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,可、可惡的...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.32,0:18:53.70,Main,Usopp,0,0,0,,魯夫...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.76,0:19:00.77,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,我不認識你們。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.18,0:19:05.79,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,我是莫利亞大人的僕人...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.79,0:19:08.73,Main,Oz,0,0,0,,奧茲！
Comment: 0,0:00:57.22,0:01:01.51,Credits,,0,0,0,,{\pos(518,550)}Title card artist\N{\fs40}
